{"id":"bestrafung","lemma":"Bestrafung","pos":"noun","rank":4613,"glosses":["punishment"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/02/De-at-Bestrafung.ogg/De-at-Bestrafung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Bestrafung","plural":"Bestrafungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie sind ihrer Bestrafung entkommen.","en":"They escaped being punished.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"she","l":"sie"},null,{"g":"to escape"}]},{"text":"Wer stiehlt, verdient Bestrafung.","en":"A person who steals deserves punishment.","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to steal","l":"stehlen"},{"g":"deserved"},null]},{"text":"Sie nahm die Bestrafung mit einem Lächeln entgegen.","en":"She took the punishment with a smile.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to take","l":"nehmen"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) a","l":"ein"},{"g":"smile"},{"g":"against"}]},{"text":"Vielleicht weiß Tom nicht, dass ihn Bestrafung erwartet.","en":"Maybe Tom doesn't know he's going to be punished.","words":[{"g":"perhaps, maybe"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"him"},null,{"g":"expected, anticipated"}]}]}